[enu default]

// Ending Texts //

//Doom
E1TEXT =
	"The reward for my survival in this...\n"
	"Demon infested base should be fair... Right?\n"
	"\n"
	"WRONG! The portal sent me to a isolated ambush zone\n"
	"Getting assaulted left and right.\n"
	"At least... I managed to survive\n"
	"But... Where am I? It smells like...\n"
	"Blood, Sulfur, Death.\n"	
	"\n"
	"Whenever am I, I'll get over it.\n"
	"Just like Kiri-Kun did.\n"
	"\n"
	"To be continued at The Shores of Hell\n";
E2TEXT =
	"Augmented guardian let the last roar\n"
	"before the massive explosion.\n"
	"\n"
	"And... What now?\n"
	"I need to rest, but I'm not in a safe area...\n"
	"But what's that? What the!?"1
	"...\n"
	"How the fuck Deimos floats above Hell itself!?\n"
	"It's... Impossible.\n"
	"How UAC's experiments caused such...\n"
	"Anomalies.\n"
	"\n"
	"Whatever, I have nowhere to go\n"
	"But descent to the Hell's surface.\n"
	"\n"
	"To be continued at Inferno.";
E3TEXT =
	"The machinery protrude out of the corpse\n"
	"of the spider demon I fought.\n"
	"Assuming that she's the mastermind of\n"
	"the assaults that happened at Phobos and Deimos.\n"
	"\n"
	"The wall nearby lowered, reveal the portal\n"
	"Nowhere to go and thus\n"
	"I heed the ''voice'' of Kiri-Kun\n"
	"And so, I step in the portal.\n"
	"\n"
	"Where am I?\n"
	"Is this... Home?\n"
	"I think I'm back home.\n"
	"I'm glad that the nightmare is over\n"
	"I was looking around for help, and...\n"
	"\n"
	"... I was wrong.";
E4TEXT =
	"Again... dealing with hellpigs\n"
	"I thought all done, but no!\n"
	"They invaded the lands\n"
	"Invaded the Earth!\n"
	"\n"
	"The longer I kill, I gotten used  to it\n"
	"even more than exterminating Kiritaka's tormentors.\n"
	"\n"
	"They promised me to see my dead son, Kiritaka.\n"
	"Are they decieving me? Or something else?\n"
	"\n"
	"Either way, I have to follow their ''demands''\n"
	"\n"
	"Time to welcome Hell on Earth.";

//Doom II	
C1TEXT =
	"The world I knew changed drastically\n"
	"how long I've been dead?\n"
	"It seems it's been...\n"
	"Two decades???\n"
	"\n"
	"Definetly world changed so much\n"
	"but either way, I need to move foward.\n"
	"\n"
	"Need to escape from this station\n"
	"ASAP!";
C2TEXT =
	"For once, you find yourself at peace,\n"
	"knowing that humanity has been evacuated\n"
	"into the cold comforts of space with the\n"
	"push of a button.\n"
	"Carnivorous mutants, bloodthirsty demons,\n"
	"and damned spirits are now your friends.\n"
	"You decided that you've performed your duty\n"
	"and proceed to stuff the barrel in your mouth.\n"
	"\n"
	"But, control calls you for your next task:\n"
	"\"A way to avert the invasion has been found\n"
	"At the city's center.......main gate\n"
	"If you destroy the entryway, th....\n"
	"...ion will slow....destroy....icon....\n"
	"invas.....will cease\"\n"
	"Looks like you haven't done your duty."
	"You're not out of the forest just yet.";
C3TEXT =
	"In the blackened heart of the thrashing city,\n"
	"your friends give off that familiar stench.\n"
	"It doesn't seem like you'll be able to\n"
	"destroy the gateway from here, so the only\n"
	"thing left to do is go through it.\n"
	"\n"
	"\n"
	"Welcome home.";
C4TEXT =
	"The godlike demon you've just slain\n"
	"bellows in pain and disintegrates\n"
	"before her eyes as you pump the\n"
	"last of your military payload into its\n"
	"diseased brain, causing the icon to\n"
	"thrash wildly and demolish untold miles\n"
	"of its own dimension.\n"
	"\n"
	"You've done it. Hell is no more.\n"
	"Humanity is saved, albeit in a damaged\n"
	"condition. Having done your duty, instead\n"
	"of eating your gun, you decide to start\n"
	"your trek back home, wanting to rebuild\n"
	"knowing no demon shall rise anytime soon.\n";
C5TEXT =
	"Where am I?\n"
	"This place seems to be... Familiar.\n"
	"Wait... I know that insignia\n"
	"\n"
	"Evil hasn't ravaged but rather\n"
	"Owned by the Evil.\n"
	"Related to those behind Kiri-Kun's death\n"
	"And blaming to my family.\n"
	"\n"
	"Shizuka... Nozomu... Okaya...\n"
	"FUCK YOU TWO!";
C6TEXT =
	"The alternate path took me to ground floor\n"
	"feeling that her fellow men waiting for me to strike.\n"
	"Time to clean the garbage yet again.\n";
